# (build 129d; lost from the tree at 130, restored in 132a) A guard for the
# lost music part the owner hears on the Mega Drive: a music track lent to an
# effect that no longer holds it stays silent until the next song. Motavia
# under its music: the C menu opened and a cursor moved (their sounds), a
# pause over them, the unpause; no music track left lent (`expect stuck`,
# smps_stuck_tracks) and the music playing again. tools/stuck_hunt.py runs
# 224 orders of this shape (docs/history.md, Builds 129d-129e); none has
# left a part lent yet.

start slot 1 routes/saves/jet_scooter.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
wait ticks 30
sound render on
press c
wait idle
press down
wait ticks 3
press start
wait ticks 20
press start
wait ticks 150
expect stuck none
expect sound playing         # the music back after the unpause
